| Error | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `Persistent table field REQUEST_NO used in mapping but not readonly-consistent` | Mismatch between mandatory/readonly declarations and mapping | Ensure `RequestNo` stays in `field(readonly)`, never `mandatory` |
| `Action parameter type ZI_SampleRejectReason not found` | Abstract entity not activated first | Activate `ZI_SampleRejectReason` before the BDEF |
| `strict(2): field control conflicts with determination` | A field is both `readonly` and targeted by a determination that's fine — but if also listed `mandatory`, conflict | Never list the same field in both `readonly` and `mandatory` |
| Projection BDEF: `action Validate not found in root` | Root BDEF not activated/saved before editing projection | Activate root BDEF first, then re-open projection BDEF editor |

