### Explanations
- **Range table (`lr_status`) built from Include + Exclude entries** — lets one field (`p_status`) plus one checkbox (`p_open`) drive filtering without writing branching dynamic-WHERE SQL; if `p_status` is blank and `p_open` is checked, the Exclude-only range correctly returns "everything except Approved/Rejected."
- **`LEFT JOIN`** on `MAKT`/`KNA1` — guarantees sample requests still display even if a material/customer master record was since archived or has a data issue, rather than silently vanishing from the report (which `INNER JOIN` would cause).
- **`CL_SALV_TABLE` + `set_color_column`** — the standard classic-ALV mechanism for per-cell coloring: each row's internal table carries its own `LVC_T_SCOL` structure naming which field (`REQ_STATUS`) gets which color, populated once during data read using the **same** status constants from the Utility Class — no duplicated status-to-color logic.
- **Hotspot on `REQUEST_NO`** — `set_cell_type( if_salv_c_cell_type=>hotspot )` turns the column into a clickable link; `SET HANDLER ... FOR lo_events` wires the click to `on_link_click`, which shows a quick popup — demonstrating interactivity as required.
- **Sorting + Subtotal** — `add_sort` groups rows by Customer then Status; `add_aggregation( 'QUANTITY' )` produces subtotal rows automatically at each sort-group break.

### Testing Steps
1. Activate the report.
2. Run via SE38/ADT "Run As → ABAP Application".
3. Leave selection screen blank, execute — should list all requests, sorted/subtotaled by customer, with color-coded status.
4. Filter by a specific customer and "Only Open Requests" checked — confirms Approved/Rejected rows excluded.
5. Click a `Req. No` hotspot — confirms popup shows the status text.

### Expected Output
ALV grid renders with striped rows, colored status column (green/red/yellow/grey), quantity subtotals per customer/status group, and functioning hotspot.

### Common Errors & Fixes

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `Field REQ_STATUS not found for color column` | `CELLCOLOR` structure's `fname` value doesn't exactly match the internal table's field name casing | Field names in `LVC_T_SCOL-FNAME` are case-insensitive but must match spelling exactly — confirmed `'REQ_STATUS'` above |
| No colors shown at all | Forgot `lo_columns->set_color_column( 'CELLCOLOR' )` | Confirm this line is present before `go_table->display( )` |
| `cx_salv_not_found` on `get_column( 'REQUEST_NO' )` | Field name mismatch (ALV auto-generates column names from itab field names in uppercase) | Match exactly the structure component name, uppercase |
| Subtotal not appearing | Sort field for the aggregated group wasn't added via `add_sort` before `add_aggregation` | Ensure `CUSTOMER`/`REQ_STATUS` sorts are added first |

